			text = [=[Tarren Mill was a human town of {link:lordaeron}Lordaeron{/link}, set among orchards in the hills below {link:alterac-mountains}Alterac{/link}. Its church and houses still stand, but its orchards are withered, and its people are the dead. The {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link} hold it as their stronghold in the south. From here {link:high-executor-darthalia}High Executor Darthalia{/link} wages war on {link:hillsbrad-foothills}Hillsbrad{/link}, and the apothecaries of the {link:royal-apothecary-society}Royal Apothecary Society{/link} brew their plagues. Bats carry riders to the {link:undercity}Undercity{/link}. A band of orcs sent by {link:thrall}Thrall{/link} also keeps its camp in the town, for the ruins of {link:durnholde-keep}Durnholde{/link} lie just across the river.]=],
