			text = [=[Durnholde Keep was once the strongest fortress of southern {link:lordaeron}Lordaeron{/link}. After the {link:second-war}Second War{/link} it was the seat of the camps where the defeated orcs were held, and Lieutenant General {link:aedelas-blackmoore}Aedelas Blackmoore{/link} ruled it. Here the infant {link:thrall}Thrall{/link} was raised as a slave. When he returned as Warchief, he broke its walls and buried its lord beneath the stones. The {link:syndicate}Syndicate{/link} has taken the ruins. Its shadow mages work there, and its jailors keep {link:orcs}orc{/link} prisoners in the old cells. An orc called Gorgrash has lately fled them, and he waits near the walls.]=],
