			text = [=[Darrow Hill rises in the north of {link:hillsbrad-foothills}Hillsbrad{/link}, below the heights of {link:alterac-mountains}Alterac{/link}. Mountain lions and stags roam its slopes, and yetis haunt the caves above it. It is wild country, and no town stands on it. It was in these hills that the wizard {link:helcular}Helcular{/link} kept his hidden lair, until the townsfolk of {link:southshore}Southshore{/link} found him. The yetis have taken his caves since, and his ritual fires still burn in the dark. The lair was a secret, and no record tells how the townsfolk learned of it.]=],
