• He sends the recovered books to {link:milton-sheaf}Milton Sheaf{/link} for the {link:royal-library}Royal Library{/link} of {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}.
• He sends the {link:syndicate}Syndicate{/link}'s coded letters to {link:prospector-stormpike}Prospector Stormpike{/link} in {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link}.]=],
