			text = [=[The letter found among the {link:syndicate}Syndicate{/link}'s thieves was written in a cipher Dibbs had never seen. He admitted as much, and sent it on to his friend in {link:ironforge}Ironforge{/link}. When it was read at last, it spoke of a power behind the Syndicate that had nothing to do with the nobles of {link:alterac-mountains}Alterac{/link}.]=],
